        <h2>Final Checklist Before Submitting</h2>
        <ul>
            <li>✅ <strong>Proofread for Zero Typos:</strong> ATS tools may misinterpret misspelled words as wrong keywords.</li>
            <li>✅ <strong>Match Job Title Standards:</strong> Ensure your job titles align with recognized industry standards.</li>
            <li>✅ <strong>Tailor for Every Submission:</strong> Modify at least 15–20% of your bullet points for each job opening.</li>
        </ul>

        <p>Using specialized tools like <strong>ResumeRocket</strong> streamlines this process by automatically applying ATS-standard layouts, optimizing typography, and allowing quick customization for every application.</p>

